<slide xmlns="http://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0" id="p1-bg">
  <style>
    <fill><fillColor color="rgb(247,249,250)"/></fill>
  </style>
  <data>
    <!-- 左侧主色 motif 竖条 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="60" width="8" height="120">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(13,108,112)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(13,108,112)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <!-- 章节标签 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="60" width="340" height="30">
      <content textType="caption" color="rgb(13,108,112)" bold="true">
        <p>BACKGROUND · 论文在解决什么问题</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <!-- 页面主标题 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="96" width="600" height="66">
      <content textType="headline" color="rgb(28,58,74)" bold="true">
        <p>为什么说“医学图像 GCD 没那么简单”？</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="64" startY="172" endX="896" endY="172">
      <border color="rgb(213,224,229)" width="2"/>
    </line>

    <!-- 痛点01 卡片：忽略文本 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="210" width="258" height="272">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="2"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="210" width="258" height="14">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(13,108,112)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(13,108,112)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="218" width="60" height="60">
      <content textType="sub-headline" color="rgb(230,166,54)" bold="true">
        <p>01</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="286" width="220" height="40">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(28,58,74)">
        <p>只用图，忽略文字</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="330" width="220" height="130">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>现有大多 GCD 只用图像模态，忽略医学里大量有价值的文本（临床报告、诊断描述）。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 痛点02 卡片：图文重要度动态变化 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="352" topLeftY="210" width="256" height="272">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="2"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="352" topLeftY="210" width="256" height="14">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(88,124,160)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(88,124,160)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="372" topLeftY="218" width="60" height="60">
      <content textType="sub-headline" color="rgb(88,124,160)" bold="true">
        <p>02</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="372" topLeftY="286" width="222" height="40">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(28,58,74)">
        <p>图文重要度动态变</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="372" topLeftY="330" width="222" height="130">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>病例之间图文重要度动态变化：有的看图即辨，有的必须靠报告才能定性。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 痛点03 卡片：预设类别数不现实 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="646" topLeftY="210" width="256" height="272">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="2"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="646" topLeftY="210" width="256" height="14">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(224,150,28)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(224,150,28)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="666" topLeftY="218" width="60" height="60">
      <content textType="sub-headline" color="rgb(224,150,28)" bold="true">
        <p>03</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="666" topLeftY="286" width="222" height="40">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(28,58,74)">
        <p>预设类别数不现实</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="666" topLeftY="330" width="222" height="130">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>传统方法需预设“未知类别数”，但真实医学场景下这个数是拍脑袋也估不准的。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 底部提示条 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="500" width="848" height="28">
      <content textType="caption" color="rgb(126,146,158)">
        <p>关键词：GCD = Generalized Category Discovery（泛化类别发现）</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>页1 · 讲问题三步走：1) GCD 大家多只喂图像；2) 但是医学病例里图文重要度在变；3) 而且类别数要预设，现实做不到。所以这是一道"图像+文本、动态模态、未知类别数"的硬题。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
</slide>
